WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.044
♪♪

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:04.463
Hello you! I'm so glad you're
here. 

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:06.798
Jack:
Welcome to the town of
Clover Grove. 

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:08.884
-Hello Jack.
-Hello Jack.

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.052
Jack:
Where one act of kindness...

00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:10.928
Surprise!

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:12.262
Jack:
...can grow and grow. 

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.847
To help you finish your big
game.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.891
Jack:
And start a chain of many
more. 

00:00:15.891 --> 00:00:17.643
Come on, we can play the game
with Cooper.

00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:20.187
(Cheering)

00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:22.856
Welcome to the Hummingbird Cafe.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.025
♪Try a little act of kindness♪

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.444
I've never been in a bus before.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.946
I'm imagining.

00:00:28.946 --> 00:00:29.529
(Beep, beep)

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.572
Hello, Bus.

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:32.324
♪Show a stranger some
politeness♪

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:33.450
You want to sit next to me?

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.743
We can be bus buddies.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:37.579
♪Watch the little moment grow
and grow♪

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:38.789
♪♪

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:40.249
That looks so great, Hugo.

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:42.793
Thanks! And thank you, Crayons.

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:43.919
Ohh, thank you. 

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:45.629
Ho-ho, you got it, Hugo.

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:47.422
♪Try a little act of kindness♪

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:51.593
♪♪

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.636
Hello, you.

